<h2>What a hardware line in a quotation should say</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Brand and series</strong> (not just "branded" or "soft-close").</li>
  <li><strong>Type</strong>: hinge overlay and opening angle; runner type and extension.</li>
  <li><strong>Load rating</strong> for drawers and lifts.</li>
  <li><strong>Quantity</strong> per cabinet, e.g. four hinges on a 7 ft shutter.</li>
  <li><strong>Warranty</strong> from the hardware maker.</li>
</ul>
